<title>GERMANY: W.German engineering orders up nine pct in July.</title>
<headline>W.German engineering orders up nine pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>West German engineering orders rose by nine percent in real terms in July from the same 1995 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said.</p>
<p>In the May to July period orders were four percent percent below the same 1995 period. The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    July change in pct	  May-July (period)  change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	     +9	 overall		-4</p>
<p>    of which German   +5	 of which German    -7</p>
<p>		 foreign +13	 foreign		unch</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
